#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:4
msgid "角显示"
msgstr "corner display"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:9
msgid "角显示节点用于在图像中检测到的对象边界框的四个角绘制L形标记，是一种简洁的可视化方式。"
msgstr ""
"The Corner Display node is used to draw L-shaped markers at the four corners"
" of the bounding box of an object detected in the image, which is a concise "
"way of visualizing it."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:11
msgid "该节点相比完整边界框更加轻量，不会遮挡过多图像内容，同时能够清晰标识出目标位置和范围。支持多种颜色方案和自定义样式配置。"
msgstr ""
"This node is more lightweight than the complete bounding box, does not block"
" too much image content, and can clearly identify the target location and "
"range.Supports multiple color schemes and custom style configurations."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:13
msgid "效果展示："
msgstr "Effect display:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:15
msgid "Corner Visualization Example"
msgstr "Corner Visualization Example"

