msgstr "**Input image**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:50
msgid "指定输入图像的来源，可以是上游节点的输出或工作流的输入参数"
msgstr ""
"Specify the source of the input image, which can be the output of an "
"upstream node or an input parameter of a workflow"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:51
msgid "``input.image``"
msgstr "``input.image``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:52
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:80
