msgstr "**COPY IMAGE**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:53
msgid "是否创建输入图像的副本进行可视化，启用后不会修改原始图像"
msgstr ""
"Whether to create a copy of the input image for visualization. When enabled,"
" the original image will not be modified."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:54
msgid "``True(推荐)``"
msgstr "``True(recommended)``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:55
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:85
msgid "**预测显示**"
msgstr "**Forecast Display**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:56
msgid "要可视化的模型预测结果，选择检测模型的输出"
msgstr "To visualize model predictions, select Detection Model Outputs"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:57
msgid "从下拉菜单选择"
msgstr "Select from drop-down menu"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:58
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:89
msgid "**调色板**"
msgstr "**Palette**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:59
msgid "颜色调色板方案，用于为不同类别分配颜色"
msgstr "Color palette scheme for assigning colors to different categories"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:60
msgid "``DEFAULT``"
msgstr "``DEFAULT``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:61
msgid "**调色板大小**"
msgstr "**Palette size**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:62
msgid "调色板中的颜色数量，适用于使用自定义或Matplotlib调色板时"
msgstr ""
"Number of colors in the palette, applicable when using a custom or "
"Matplotlib palette"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:63
msgid "``10``"
msgstr "``10``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:64
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:97
msgid "**自定义颜色**"
msgstr "**Custom Color**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:65
msgid "自定义颜色列表，使用HEX格式定义角标记颜色"
msgstr "Custom color list, using HEX format to define corner marker colors"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:66
msgid "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"
msgstr "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:67
msgid "**颜色坐标轴**"
msgstr "**Color Axis**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:68
msgid "颜色分配的依据，通常基于类别（CLASS）来着色"
msgstr ""
"The basis for color assignment, usually coloring based on category (CLASS)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:69
msgid "``CLASS``"
msgstr "``CLASS``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:70
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:115
msgid "**角框粗细**"
msgstr "**Corner frame thickness**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:71
msgid "角标记线条的粗细（像素）"
msgstr "Corner marker line thickness (pixels)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:72
msgid "``4``"
msgstr "``4``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:73
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:125
msgid "**角框长度**"
msgstr "**Corner frame length**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:74
msgid "角标记的长度（像素）"
msgstr "Length of corner marker (pixels)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:75
msgid "``15``"
msgstr "``15``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:78
msgid "参数详细说明"
msgstr "Detailed description of parameters"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:82
msgid "**True**：创建图像副本，原始图像保持不变，可用于后续其他可视化操作"
msgstr ""
"**True**: Create a copy of the image, the original image remains unchanged "
"and can be used for other subsequent visualization operations"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:83
msgid "**False**：直接在原图上绘制，节省内存但会修改原图"
msgstr ""
"**False**: Draw directly on the original image, saving memory but modifying "
"the original image."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:87
msgid "选择要可视化的检测模型预测输出。从下拉菜单中选择上游检测模型节点的输出结果，支持目标检测、实例分割等模型类型。"
msgstr ""
"Select the detection model prediction output to visualize.Select the output "
"result of the upstream detection model node from the drop-down menu, "
"supporting model types such as target detection and instance segmentation."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:91
msgid "支持多种颜色调色板方案："
msgstr "Supports multiple color palette schemes:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:93
msgid "``DEFAULT``：系统默认配色方案"
msgstr "``DEFAULT``: system default color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:94
msgid "``MATPLOTLIB``：使用Matplotlib的颜色方案"
msgstr "``MATPLOTLIB``: Use Matplotlib's color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:95
msgid "``CUSTOM``：使用自定义颜色列表（需配置自定义颜色参数）"
msgstr ""
"``CUSTOM``: Use a custom color list (custom color parameters need to be "
"configured)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:99
msgid "当调色板选择 ``CUSTOM`` 时，使用HEX格式定义颜色列表："
msgstr ""
"When ``CUSTOM`` is selected for the palette, use HEX format to define the "
"color list:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:105
msgid "分别对应红色、绿色、蓝色、黄色、紫色，颜色会按顺序分配给不同的类别。"
msgstr ""
"Corresponding to red, green, blue, yellow, and purple, the colors will be "
"assigned to different categories in order."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:107
msgid "**颜色坐标轴(在CUSTOM模式下会被忽略)**"
msgstr "**Color axis (ignored in CUSTOM mode)**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:109
msgid "决定如何为检测结果分配颜色："
msgstr "Decide how to assign colors to detection results:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:111
msgid "``CLASS``：根据物体类别着色，同类物体使用相同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``CLASS``: Color according to object category, similar objects use the same "
"color"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:112
msgid "``INDEX``：为每个物体分配不同颜色"
msgstr "``INDEX``: assign a different color to each object"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:113
msgid "``TRACK``：根据Tracker ID着色，每个Tracker ID使用不同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``TRACK``: Colored according to Tracker ID, use different colors for each "
"Tracker ID"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:117
msgid "设置角标记线条的粗细程度，单位为像素。默认值为 ``4``。"
msgstr ""
"Set the thickness of the corner marker lines in pixels.The default value is "
"``4``."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:119
msgid "``2``：较细的线条"
msgstr "``2``: thinner lines"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:120
msgid "``4``：标准粗细（默认）"
msgstr "``4``: Standard thickness (default)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:121
msgid "``6`` 及以上：较粗的线条"
msgstr "``6`` and above: thicker lines"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:123
msgid "线条越粗，角标记越明显。"
msgstr "The thicker the line, the more obvious the corner markings will be."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:127
msgid "设置每个角标记的长度，单位为像素。默认值为 ``15``。"
msgstr ""
"Sets the length of each corner marker in pixels.The default value is ``15``."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:129
msgid "``10``：较短的角标记"
msgstr "``10``: shorter corner mark"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:130
msgid "``15``：标准长度（默认）"
msgstr "``15``: standard length (default)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:131
msgid "``20`` 及以上：较长的角标记"
msgstr "``20`` and above: longer corner markers"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/corner_display.rst:133
msgid "角框长度越长，标识范围越明显，但可能遮挡更多图像内容。建议根据检测目标的大小调整此参数。"
msgstr ""
"The longer the corner frame, the more obvious the logo will be, but may "
"block more of the image content.It is recommended to adjust this parameter "
"according to the size of the detection target."
